{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794543775177,"sessionID":"ses_e2cdb5fd3ffejln5isXnr1g1SL","part":{"partID":"prt_1d324eb08002rJHlqb35tI0V15","sessionID":"ses_e2cdb5fd3ffejln5isXnr1g1SL","messageID":"msg_1d324dc2f001bZ3Ud049FEeIdV","type":"tool","id":"call_eb66630f7f744ff0b274e851","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"^- \\[ \\] T008 ","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/tasks.md"},"output":"Found 1 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/tasks.md:\n  Line 116: - [ ] T008 Rebuild and recapture after wave A (`BASE`). Run `BLD`, then `node $CAP --write`. Verify: `jq -c '.attachedMetrics.plain.tune' $BASE` prints `{\"own\":7,\"attached\":7,\"combined\":14,\"total\":45}` (expectation), `jq -r '.rows[\"cmd-doctor-agents-md-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-ci-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-helper-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-deep-loop-plain-tune-01\"].top3' $BASE` prints `command-doctor-agents-md-check`, `command-doctor-ci-report`, `command-doctor-helper` and `true`, `jq -c '.metrics.false_offer, .attachedMetrics.false_offer_attached' $BASE` prints `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}` twice and `RS` reports 0 failed. When the tune line differs from the expectation but the floors hold, write the actual line into `$SP/after-A.txt` in T009 and continue.\n","title":"grep","metadata":{"metadata":{"matches":1,"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found 1 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/tasks.md:\n  Line 116: - [ ] T008 Rebuild and recapture after wave A (`BASE`). Run `BLD`, then `node $CAP --write`. Verify: `jq -c '.attachedMetrics.plain.tune' $BASE` prints `{\"own\":7,\"attached\":7,\"combined\":14,\"total\":45}` (expectation), `jq -r '.rows[\"cmd-doctor-agents-md-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-ci-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-helper-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-deep-loop-plain-tune-01\"].top3' $BASE` prints `command-doctor-agents-md-check`, `command-doctor-ci-report`, `command-doctor-helper` and `true`, `jq -c '.metrics.false_offer, .attachedMetrics.false_offer_attached' $BASE` prints `{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}` twice and `RS` reports 0 failed. When the tune line differs from the expectation but the floors hold, write the actual line into `$SP/after-A.txt` in T009 and continue.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"^- \\\\[ \\\\] T008 \",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/tasks.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794543774472,"end":1794543775177}}}}
