{"type":"text","timestamp":1794543950307,"sessionID":"ses_e2cdb5fd3ffejln5isXnr1g1SL","part":{"id":"prt_1d3278a68002q4FSsHOI6ZNLve","sessionID":"ses_e2cdb5fd3ffejln5isXnr1g1SL","messageID":"msg_1d3277414001bNJQkcpTM3WSxM","type":"text","text":"T008 is complete. `BLD` exited 0, the recapture wrote the new baseline, and all four verify clauses printed their expected values.\n\nFiles written:\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` (`BASE`, recaptured by `node $CAP --write`, 49 insertions and 49 deletions against HEAD)\n- The `npm run build` run also regenerated the ignored `runtime/dist` build output, as `BLD` requires. No other sourced file changed, and the scoped diff contains no prompt text and no task residue.\n\nVerify output:\n\n```\n$ jq -c '.attachedMetrics.plain.tune' $BASE\n{\"own\":7,\"attached\":7,\"combined\":14,\"total\":45}\n\n$ jq -r '.rows[\"cmd-doctor-agents-md-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-ci-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-helper-plain-tune-01\"].top, .rows[\"cmd-doctor-deep-loop-plain-tune-01\"].top3' $BASE\ncommand-doctor-agents-md-check\ncommand-doctor-ci-report\ncommand-doctor-helper\ntrue\n\n$ jq -c '.metrics.false_offer, .attachedMetrics.false_offer_attached' $BASE\n{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}\n{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}\n\n$ npx vitest run tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts   (in ADV, RS)\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  4 passed (4)\nEXIT:0\n```\n\nThe tune line matched the expectation exactly, so T009 has no \"actual line differs\" note to carry.\n\nI did not tick the T008 checkbox, as instructed. T008 did not name `$SP/after-A.txt`, so I did not write it.\n\nSKILL ROUTING: sk-code loaded (advisor confidence 0.82). REPO RULES: evidence-and-proof, scope-discipline, blast-radius, communication, communication-handoff.\n\nStatus: work is edited in the working tree on branch `worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research`, not committed and not pushed. Nothing is inferred beyond the observed command outputs above, and no residual risk is known. Nothing is blocked on the operator.","time":{"start":1794543946344,"end":1794543950307}}}
